UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, recover 1 AP. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-EXECUTIONER' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, recover 1 AP.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, recover 15% Max HP. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-BLOOD-HARVEST' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, recover 15% Max HP.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, recover 10% Max MP. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-SOUL-HARVEST' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, recover 10% Max MP.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, recover 30% of the Skill''s MP cost. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-KILL-MOMENTUM-MP' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, recover 30% of the Skill''s MP cost.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, remove one dispellable debuff from the caster using normal stable-priority dispel. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-PURIFYING-KILL' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats at least one enemy, remove one dispellable debuff from the caster using normal stable-priority dispel.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats an enemy, caster gains +25% damage reduction for 1 full round. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-FORTIFY-ON-KILL' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats an enemy, caster gains +25% damage reduction for 1 full round.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, caster''s CT for next turn is reduced by 30%. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-MOMENTUM' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, caster''s CT for next turn is reduced by 30%.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, the caster may immediately perform the same Skill again on a different valid target within range at no additional AP cost. Second use cannot trigger Chain Kill. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-CHAIN-KILL' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, the caster may immediately perform the same Skill again on a different valid target within range at no additional AP cost. Second use cannot trigger Chain Kill.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='Only when supported Skill primary damage itself reduces an enemy to 0 HP: adjacent units take Fire damage equal to 25% defeated Max HP. Does not trigger from explosions, collision, falling, map objects, DoT, terrain, reactions, Mana Rupture, or passive follow-ups. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-EXPLOSIVE-DEATH' AND "Effect" IS 'Only when supported Skill primary damage itself reduces an enemy to 0 HP: adjacent units take Fire damage equal to 25% defeated Max HP. Does not trigger from explosions, collision, falling, map objects, DoT, terrain, reactions, Mana Rupture, or passive follow-ups.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, reduce all enemies within 2 tiles of the defeated unit''s physical defense by 20% for 2 turns. Enemies only: the defense reduction never affects allies, neutrals or objects. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-SHATTERING-DEATH' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, reduce all enemies within 2 tiles of the defeated unit''s physical defense by 20% for 2 turns.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, all enemies within 3 tiles of the defeated unit are displaced 1 tile away from the death location. Enemies only: the push never moves allies, neutrals or objects. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-TERRIFYING-DEATH' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, all enemies within 3 tiles of the defeated unit are displaced 1 tile away from the death location.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, apply Poison to all enemies within 2 tiles of the defeated unit. Enemies only: the Poison never affects allies, neutrals or objects. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-TOXIC-DEATH' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, apply Poison to all enemies within 2 tiles of the defeated unit.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, deal excess damage (overkill amount, capped at 50% of original damage) as Physical damage to one enemy within 2 tiles of the defeated unit. Closest valid enemy selected. Enemies only: the splash never hits allies, neutrals or objects. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-OVERKILL-SPLASH' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill defeats an enemy, deal excess damage (overkill amount, capped at 50% of original damage) as Physical damage to one enemy within 2 tiles of the defeated unit. Closest valid enemy selected.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='Each time the supported Skill defeats an enemy, summon a Soul Echo (1 HP, 0 defense, cannot act) on that defeated unit''s tile. This fires on EVERY kill the Skill makes, including each kill in an AOE multi-kill, so one cast that defeats N enemies spawns N echoes. Each Soul Echo persists for 1 turn and detonates at end of turn, dealing 30% of ITS OWN kill''s damage as Dark damage to all enemies within 1 tile. Enemies only: the detonation never hits allies, neutrals or objects. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-SOUL-ECHO' AND "Effect" IS 'Each time the supported Skill defeats an enemy, summon a Soul Echo (1 HP, 0 defense, cannot act) on that defeated unit''s tile. This fires on EVERY kill the Skill makes, including each kill in an AOE multi-kill, so one cast that defeats N enemies spawns N echoes. Each Soul Echo persists for 1 turn and detonates at end of turn, dealing 30% of ITS OWN kill''s damage as Dark damage to all enemies within 1 tile.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats an enemy eligible to generate Gold, increase that enemy’s generated Gold by 25%. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-GOLD-HARVEST' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats an enemy eligible to generate Gold, increase that enemy’s generated Gold by 25%.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='If the supported Skill directly defeats an enemy and it successfully generates an eligible ordinary reward, apply Augment Quality Weight Multiplier ×1.25 to the selected category’s eligible nonzero quality weights before normalization. Kill rule: triggers only when this Skill defeats an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Reinforcements, hostile event units and neutrals that have turned hostile count.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-TREASURE-HUNTER' AND "Effect" IS 'If the supported Skill directly defeats an enemy and it successfully generates an eligible ordinary reward, apply Augment Quality Weight Multiplier ×1.25 to the selected category’s eligible nonzero quality weights before normalization.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='After hitting primary target, projectile bounces to 1 additional enemy within 3 tiles of primary target. Bounce target takes 50% of primary damage. Prioritizes closest enemy. Enemies only: the bounce never hits allies, neutrals or objects.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-BOUNCE-SHOT' AND "Effect" IS 'After hitting primary target, projectile bounces to 1 additional enemy within 3 tiles of primary target. Bounce target takes 50% of primary damage. Prioritizes closest enemy.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='Skill projectile pierces through the primary target and hits the unit behind the target (the next tile directly behind it, in line from the caster), whichever side that unit is on (enemy, ally or neutral). Secondary target takes 60% of primary damage.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-PIERCING-SHOT' AND "Effect" IS 'Skill projectile pierces through the primary target and hits 1 additional enemy directly behind the target (in line from caster). Secondary target takes 60% of primary damage.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Effect"='Skill additionally hits units on the adjacent tiles: the tiles next to the primary target that are also next to the caster (cleave arc), whichever side those units are on (enemy, ally or neutral). Adjacent targets take 40% of primary damage.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-WIDE-ARC' AND "Effect" IS 'Skill additionally hits enemies on tiles adjacent to the primary target that are also adjacent to the caster (cleave arc). Adjacent targets take 40% of primary damage.';
UPDATE "augments" SET "Kill_Credit_Dependency"='Supported Skill directly defeats a qualifying enemy: an enemy that was not summoned (by a skill, augment or item) and has not been revived this battle. Counts: mid-battle reinforcements, hostile event units, neutrals that have turned hostile (a Traitor counts if it dies while still an enemy). Does not count: allies, neutrals, objects, summoned units, revived units. Applies both ways (enemy units with this augment get nothing for killing summoned or revived player units). USER RULING 2026-10-26.' WHERE "Augment_ID"='AUG-EXECUTIONER' AND "Kill_Credit_Dependency" IS 'Primary Skill damage directly causes enemy KO';
